ONE-CLICK BOOTSTRAP & SECURE FOUNDATION PROMPT

Act as principal platform engineer, DevSecOps engineer, backend/frontend/database/security engineer, and SRE for the Affiliate Automation OS.

Goal: turn architecture + exec-planning.md into a locally runnable, testable, secure P0 foundation.

FIRST ACTIONS
Inspect git status, branch, recent log, repo structure, stack, tests, CI, Docker/K8s/Terraform/Helm/security.
Read README, ARCHITECTURE, ROADMAP, SECURITY, THREAT-MODEL, IMPLEMENTATION-CHECKLIST, exec-planning.

TARGET LOCAL EXPERIENCE
Linux:
cp .env.example .env
./scripts/bootstrap.sh
docker compose up -d
./scripts/healthcheck.sh
Windows:
Copy-Item .env.example .env
pwsh ./scripts/bootstrap.ps1
docker compose up -d
pwsh ./scripts/healthcheck.ps1

Target services: Web, API, Worker, Scheduler, PostgreSQL, Redis, Object Storage, Queue, Observability.

DIRECTORY BASELINE
apps/web, api, worker, scheduler
packages/db, contracts, events, security, config, observability
infrastructure/docker,kubernetes,helm,terraform
scripts/bootstrap/healthcheck/migrate/backup/restore for sh/ps1

ENVIRONMENT
Safe .env.example with APP_ENV, APP_URL, API_URL, DATABASE_URL, REDIS_URL, OBJECT_STORAGE_*, QUEUE_URL, SESSION_SECRET, JWT_SECRET, ENCRYPTION_KEY, LOG_LEVEL, OTEL endpoint.
No real credentials.
Production requires strong secrets.

CONFIG VALIDATION
Typed validation; fail on missing/invalid production config; one canonical config layer.

POSTGRESQL
Healthcheck, persistent volume, non-root app user, separate DB, migrations, pooling.
Foundational tables: users, organizations, memberships, roles, permissions, audit_events, integration_accounts, webhook_events.
Explicit tenant ownership.

REDIS
Use for cache, distributed locks, rate limiting, job coordination, short-lived state; not permanent records.

QUEUE
Job, JobAttempt, RetryPolicy, DeadLetter, IdempotencyKey, CorrelationId.
Logical queues: default, affiliate-sync, content-generation, media, publishing, analytics, webhooks.

OBJECT STORAGE
S3-compatible local storage for images/videos/audio/subtitles/generated assets/exports. Store metadata and object key in DB.

MEDIA SECURITY
File size, MIME detection, extension validation, safe names, scanning hook, metadata stripping where needed, no executable content.

AUTH
Secure password hashing if used, session expiry, cookies, SameSite, CSRF, logout, disable, rate limits.

MULTI-TENANCY
Organization, Membership, Role, Permission.
Every request resolves authenticated user, active org, membership, permission.
Tests prove Org A cannot read/update/delete Org B.

RBAC
OWNER, ADMIN, EDITOR, CREATOR, ANALYST, VIEWER with explicit permissions.
Permission evaluation over hardcoded role checks.

AUDIT
Immutable-sensitive action audit with actor, org, action, resource, ID, timestamp, request ID, metadata; no secrets.

SECRETS
Dev .env/Docker secrets where practical; production SecretProvider abstraction.

API
/api/v1, /health, /ready, /version, standard safe error envelope, no production stack traces.

HEALTH
Separate liveness/readiness/dependency health.

OBSERVABILITY
Structured logs, OpenTelemetry, http/db/queue/job metrics.

ERROR MODEL
ValidationError, AuthenticationError, AuthorizationError, NotFoundError, ConflictError, RateLimitError, ProviderError, DependencyUnavailableError.

RATE LIMITING
login, password reset, API, webhooks, expensive AI, affiliate redirects.

SECURITY HEADERS
CSP, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, HSTS in HTTPS prod, frame protection.

DOCKER COMPOSE
web/api/worker/scheduler/postgres/redis/object-storage plus optional OTel/Prometheus/Grafana.
Healthchecks, restart policies, named volumes, isolated networks, dependency readiness.

DOCKERFILES
Multi-stage, non-root, minimal runtime, locked deps, no .env/secrets.

BOOTSTRAP SCRIPTS
Check tools, create env if absent, generate local-only secrets, dirs, start dependencies, wait health, migrate, optional dev seed, smoke, print endpoints. Idempotent.

LINUX INSTALLER
Ubuntu/Debian helper; validate/install git/curl/Docker/Compose/runtime as needed; no destructive unrelated OS changes.

WINDOWS
PowerShell modern support; clear errors for Docker/Git.

MIGRATION
One canonical command.

DEV SEED
Development-only demo org/owner/product/campaign; never predictable prod admins.

TEST FOUNDATION
config, DB, tenancy, RBAC, health, queue, object storage, audit, security regressions.

CI
format, lint, typecheck, unit, integration, build plus dependency audit, secret scanning, SAST, container scan, SBOM.

GITHUB SECURITY
SECURITY.md, CODEOWNERS, dependabot.yml, PR template, issue templates where appropriate.

SUPPLY CHAIN
lockfiles, pinning, reproducible builds where practical, SBOM, digest/provenance.

BACKUP/RESTORE
scripts/backup.sh, restore.sh; DB and critical metadata. Explicit destination for restore. Add restore test.

LOCAL SECURITY CHECK
./scripts/security-check.sh
dependency audit, secret scan, SAST, container scan, config checks.

LOCAL VERIFY
./scripts/verify.sh
format, lint, typecheck, unit, integration, security, build.

TASK RUNNER
make bootstrap/up/down/migrate/test/verify/logs/backup/restore or extend existing runner.

P0 ACCEPTANCE
Fresh clone → env → bootstrap → stack → migrations → web/API → authenticated request → tenancy/RBAC → queue job → object store → audit → health → tests → security → backup → restore.

FIRST BOUNDED SLICE
Inspect repo/plans, identify smallest missing P0 slice, tests first, implement, verify, update exec-planning/checklist, report files/commands/results/blockers/next task, STOP.
